      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start, you need to identify the requirements for your trip."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening unit implicitly starts the process and describes the initial step. 'start the trip planning' faithfully paraphrases identifying trip requirements."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n3",
